# takeFirst

- _takeFirst([x₁ x₂ …], n, y)_

Answer a copy of the sequence _x_ with only the first _n_ places.
Fill any empty slots with the object _y_.

```
>>> [5 4 3 2 1].takeFirst(3, 0)
[5 4 3]

>>> [5 4 3 2 1].takeFirst(8, 0)
[5 4 3 2 1 0 0 0]
```

* * *

See also: take, takeLast

